{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/228372-integrating-cheiron-group-into-classic-world-of-darkness","id":228372,"title":"Integrating Cheiron Group into Classic World of Darkness","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-14T12:48:36-07:00","id":228372,"title":"Integrating Cheiron Group into Classic World of Darkness","content":"I think Cheiron Group could be an interesting alternative to Developmental Neogenetics Amalgamated. Instead of a group that has monomaniacal obsession with werewolves, we have company that does not... discriminate. And the shenanigans with &quot;Thaumatechnology&quot; can certainly make for interesting chronicle. <br /> <br /> Cheiron group could also serve as foil to Pentex, Magadon in particular. Hey, Cheiron is shady and its treatment of field agents raises questions, but they don't worship spirits of corruption! (Okay, I read on rumors concerning their Board of Directors, still less suspicious than Pentex one). <br /> <br /> I would also consider merging CyberSolutions with Cheiron Group. Cheiron Group does include prosthetics in their official portfolio, and planting questionable cyber implants would be as easy for them as planting bits of monsters.<br /> <br /> As of their origins:<br /> <br /> - a front for Progenitors who test out their xenotransplants through the company?<br /> <br /> - an ancient cabal of Mages, split from Hippocratean Circle? Or maybe even from the Cosian Circle? Or perhaps they are the true remnant of the Cosian Circle?<br /> <br /> - shapeshifting alien immortals from parallel world, as Compacts and Conspiracies suggest?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T05:40:42-07:00","id":229002,"title":"","content":"Doesn't the Cheiron Group already exist in cWoD? I am pretty sure I read something about them in a Hunters book.<br /> <br /> *UPDATE* Ignore my original post, I was getting my Hunters editions mixed up. I don't think this would really be hard to port back to your game.<br /> <br /> From a Werewolf perspective the books say that agents of the Wyrm have a bad habit of stepping on each others toes. They could have a different patron spirit that functions similarly, or on of the Weavers Incarna might be acting directly through them, The Science Incarna would fit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1619,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1619-derzhuzad","user":"Derzhuzad","date":". 08-15-2014, 08:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1619-derzhuzad","name":"Derzhuzad","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1619_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"652"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T09:29:07-07:00","id":229125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> From a Werewolf perspective the books say that agents of the Wyrm have a bad habit of stepping on each others toes. They could have a different patron spirit that functions similarly, or on of the Weavers Incarna might be acting directly through them, The Science Incarna would fit. </div> </div> </div>I prefer The Triat to stay away, since I don't want a Pentex 2: Electric Boogaloo. You can be evil, shady and not be a thrall to some higher power. <br /> <br /> Cheiron could experiment on supernaturals not only to learn their weaknesses and make 'use' of them for their own benefit, but in the long term to elevate the human race into the state of absolute domination over the supernatural. Not make the world safer like Technocrats preach, but make Humanity better at all cost except for selling their souls like Pentex does.<br /> <br /> The most careful ask to-day: &quot;How is man to be maintained?&quot; Cheiron however asketh, as the first and only one: &quot;How is man to be surpassed?&quot;<br /> <br /> Etherites cling to the folly of their individualistic and self-centered paradigms, Progenitors are too shackled by Technocratic dogma and ethics, Iteration X pursue the transhumanism but are too obsessed about cogs and machines to see the big picture, Syndicate is all about lowest denominator for everyone, New World Order is adamant about securing Humanity from the supernatural, but not taking advantage of it, Void Engineers gaze at stars, but pays little attention what is at the surface. Still, some of their lot make good &quot;customers&quot;.<br /> <br /> Pentex worships spirits instead of being their own masters, and accepts bloodsuckers and mongrels in their midst. They do not have Superman at their hearts, like Cheiron group does.<br /> <br /> PS. Whole writeup is of course from the subjectic viewpoint of my version of Cheiron Group and a piece of propaganda, Warhammer 40K Codex style. Schedules are bitch to deal with, but when I find time, I should make whole write up of Stereotypes, adorned with quotes from Thus Spake Zarathusthra, as some probably noticed.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T09:51:11-07:00","id":229164,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katsura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/228372-integrating-cheiron-group-into-classic-world-of-darkness?p=229125#post229125\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I prefer The Triat to stay away, since I don't want a Pentex 2: Electric Boogaloo. You can be evil, shady and not be a thrall to some higher power.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>They don't have to know that they attract banes and weaver-spirits. But they will, regardless of that fact, if you plan on using Werewolf. Given Cheiron's practices, it's pretty much a certainty that the facilities will be filthy with banes savoring the cruelty and hurt, and encouraging the technicians to go further. It's not exactly being in thrall, of course. The spirits just see a kindred spirit in all of the medical torture, and work to encourage it, until all of Cheiron's staff is just like the manifestation of corruption, as the banes themselves are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T10:29:11-07:00","id":229199,"title":"","content":"But that clashes with my vision of Cheiron as something other than Pentex 2. I'm not much fond of cramming Wyrm everywhere like Werewolf does.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T15:21:35-07:00","id":229624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katsura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/228372-integrating-cheiron-group-into-classic-world-of-darkness?p=229199#post229199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But that clashes with my vision of Cheiron as something other than Pentex 2. I'm not much fond of cramming Wyrm everywhere like Werewolf does.</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn't cram it in. It arises from peoples' actions as a natural consequence. If you're engaging in a fair amount of shit that banes would just love, you're going to attract banes. If you don't know that banes are around and using their influence powers, you're going to be vulnerable to their constant entreaties to act the way they want you to. It's the way that Werewolf's animist setup works.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T16:15:34-07:00","id":229670,"title":"","content":"You know, if Cheiron knows how to &quot;harvest&quot; parts of friggin' NWoD Demons and Ghosts, I assume they would be aware of Banes and possibly have means to &quot;firewall&quot; their influence (it's more logical than engaging with stuff that you cannot really control and would corrupt your field agents). That would emphasize a fundamental difference between Cheiron and Pentex. Pentex gives into darkness for patronage and benefits of Wyrm spirits, Cheiron would be that kind of control freak that distrusts what he cannot control effectively and would refuse to have anything to do with Banes or other Umbral spirits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T16:57:32-07:00","id":229702,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katsura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/228372-integrating-cheiron-group-into-classic-world-of-darkness?p=229670#post229670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You know, if Cheiron knows how to &quot;harvest&quot; parts of friggin' NWoD Demons and Ghosts, I assume they would be aware of Banes and possibly have means to &quot;firewall&quot; their influence (it's more logical than engaging with stuff that you cannot really control and would corrupt your field agents). That would emphasize a fundamental difference between Cheiron and Pentex. Pentex gives into darkness for patronage and benefits of Wyrm spirits, Cheiron would be that kind of control freak that distrusts what he cannot control effectively and would refuse to have anything to do with Banes or other Umbral spirits.</div> </div> </div> </div>Like Shikuzi Industries? They're Weaver-bound instead of Wyrm-tainted. Tremendous control freaks. But working for them tends to lead one into hearing the OneSong and then into Drone-dom.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-15T17:07:01-07:00","id":229721,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Like Shikuzi Industries? They're Weaver-bound instead of Wyrm-tainted. Tremendous control freaks. But working for them tends to lead one into hearing the OneSong and then into Drone-dom. </div> </div> </div>That does not sound like Cheiron style, since they are pretty creative and inventive about their Thaumasurgery. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}